; inspectroute.eval - the monster inspector and its patrol routes (code-review
; C80, C104, C99, and C233's editor-map-only rule). Judged by tools/EditorTest.py
; phase 23, on its scratch world; casterload.eval reads the saves back.
;
; eval_arena's monsters stand where they were put (timescale 0): A is the
; skel_warrior at 23,9, B the skeleton at 12,6.
;
;   --- c80 ---     inspect A, Edit route, three waypoints; right-click B (its
;                   inspector opens), Esc, then Enter finishes A's route - and
;                   the inspector that reopens must be A's, with A's three
;                   waypoints (it used to reopen on B, showing A's count).
;   --- c104 ---    on the Patrol tab, Clear route: the rebuild keeps the Patrol
;                   tab (it used to drop back to the AI tab) and shows 0.
;   --- player ---  a route with two waypoints, then the PLAYER map: its keys are
;                   not the route's (Backspace keeps both, Esc finishes nothing);
;                   back on the editor map they are.
;   --- caster ---  B made a Caster in its inspector, the skel_coward TYPE made
;                   one in the monster dialog: each shows a spell, holds that
;                   same spell, and saves it (the .ent and monsters.cat, which
;                   the judge reads).

logecho on
reset
timescale 0
echo --- c80 ---
editor inspect 23 9
editor inspector
editor inspector editroute
editor route 23 11
editor route 22 11
editor route 21 11
editor route
editor inspect 12 6
editor inspector
editor inspector esc
editor route key enter
editor route
editor inspector
echo --- c104 ---
editor inspector tab 1
editor inspector
editor inspector clearroute
editor inspector
echo --- player ---
editor inspector editroute
editor route 23 11
editor route 22 11
editor off
editor route key back
editor route
editor route key esc
editor route
editor
editor route key back
editor route
editor route key esc
editor route
editor inspector
editor inspector esc
echo --- caster ---
editor inspect 12 6
editor inspector archetype caster
editor inspector save
editor inspector
monsterdialog skel_coward
monsterdialog archetype caster
monsterdialog save
monsterdialog
echo --- end ---
